/* Propshaft/Sprockets both support ERB preprocessing for CSS that needs
 * asset_path/asset_url resolved before being served. The final bytes (and
 * therefore the digest computed over them) are only known after Ruby
 * evaluates this file -- Stage 4 Task 6's fixture case for a real,
 * non-guessable asset URL. */
.logo {
  background-image: url(<%= asset_path('logo.png') %>);
}
